@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = 여기에_토큰_붙여넣기
@workspaceId = 여기에_워크스페이스id_붙여넣기
@channelId = 여기에_채널id_붙여넣기

### 채널 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 생성 (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/channels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "general",
  "topic": "전체 공지",
  "isPrivate": false
}

###

### 채널 생성 (private)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/channels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "secret",
  "isPrivate": true
}

###

### 채널 단건 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 수정 (OWNER/ADMIN만) — topic 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "topic": "수정된 topic"
}

###

### 채널 참여 (public만 가능) — 204 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 참여 중복 시도 — 409 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Private 채널 참여 시도 — 403 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/private채널id직접입력/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 멤버 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 나가기 — 204 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 나가기 중복 시도 — 404 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 채널 삭제 (OWNER/ADMIN만) — 204 예상
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
